{"id": "39384", "title": "百妇谱", "author": "晃儿", "category": "其他类型", "count": 25, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/39/39384.htm", "intro": "酷刑生生死死，醒醒迷迷，涎涎便便尿尿。\r\n 　　鞭去鞭来抽打，周身血泡。\r\n 　　三杯两盏椒水，怎敌他、束发钩吊。\r\n 　　酷吏也，太阴毒、弄鬼装神胡闹。\r\n 　　任尔滥刑施暴。\r\n 　　老娘我，伶齿俐牙讥诮。\r\n 　　恣意淫羞，此恨来生必报。\r\n 　　滑轮板钉木杵，市曹间、人声浮噪。\r\n 　　那惨烈，怎一个、”疼“字了得？\r\n 　　第一回泄私忿夫人抛宠婢，圆旧梦周氏购大宅残花抛野荒，哀怨盛满腔。\r\n 　　败柳嫁新枝，怅然守寒窗。\r\n 　　昔日品珍馐，今朝嚼糟糠。\r\n 　　人生多变故，前程渺茫茫。", "base": "files/article/html/39/39384", "chapters": [{"title": "刑妇1", "file": "3777127.html", "available": false}, {"title": "刑妇2", "file": "3777128.html", "available": false}, {"title": "刑妇3", "file": "3777129.html", "available": false}, {"title": "刑妇4", "file": "3777130.html", "available": false}, {"title": "刑妇5", "file": "3777131.html", "available": false}, {"title": "刑妇6", "file": "3777132.html", "available": false}, {"title": "刑妇7", "file": "3777133.html", "available": false}, {"title": "刑妇8", "file": "3777134.html", "available": false}, {"title": "婢妇1", "file": "3777135.html", "available": false}, {"title": "婢妇2", "file": "3777136.html", "available": false}, {"title": "豪妇", "file": "3777137.html", "available": false}, {"title": "殉妇", "file": "3777138.html", "available": false}, {"title": "囚妇", "file": "3777139.html", "available": false}, {"title": "贵妇", "file": "3777140.html", "available": false}, {"title": "寡妇1", "file": "3777141.html", "available": false}, {"title": "寡妇2", "file": "3777142.html", "available": false}, {"title": "雏妇1", "file": "3777143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "雏妇2", "file": "3777144.html", "available": false}, {"title": "雏妇3", "file": "3777145.html", "available": false}, {"title": "娼妇1", "file": "3777146.html", "available": false}, {"title": "娼妇2", "file": "3777147.html", "available": false}, {"title": "（1）", "file": "3777148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "（2）", "file": "3777149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "（3）", "file": "3777150.html", "available": false}, {"ti